      "writtenOn": "2024-11-07T23:01:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think we want a new module type for this. The system_other partition already knows it\u0027s avb key. I think the product partition should have a `public_avb_key_of` property, that points to the system_other partition. The system_other partition will likely need to depend on all the other partition to get their odex files though, so we may need to make a sub-partition that just exports the avb key to break the cycle.\n\nHowever, that might be too complicated for now. A simpler solution would be to keep this module type, but give it a `private_key` property, and have it use that. The autogenerated copy of this module would set the same private key as was set on the system_other partition.",
      "revId": "e4629b25e2945445edccbd757232398015ad09f0",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "fdfc9f82_a1ab6c10",
        "filename": "etc/avbpubkey.go",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 50,
      "author": {
        "id": 1962375
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-11-11T19:19:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not sure if I understand your intent correctly, do you mind clarifying the questions below?\n\n\u003e keep this module type, but give it a `private_key` property, and have it use that.\n\nSo IIUC you\u0027d prefer the module to set the path property that points to the key filepath? If this is the case, should this `avbpubkey` module be defined in `external/.../Android.bp` ?\n\n\u003e autogenerated copy of this module would set the same private key as was set on the system_other partition\n\nWhy do we need an autogenerated copy of the module (copy of the one defined in `external/...` I assume?)? Is it to install the artifact (`*.avbpubkey` file) to both system_other and product partition?",
      "parentUuid": "42a7b17c_0e7b50d3",
      "revId": "e4629b25e2945445edccbd757232398015ad09f0",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
